# ZVIEW04 control: File > Quit WITHOUT the browser (zView's start state, no
# window). Expected: zView exits, the desktop comes back.
100 parkbr
3000 mark Q00_IDLE
3100 move 76 8
3400 mark Q01_FILEMENU
3500 move 100 204
3700 mark Q02_ONQUIT
3800 down
3803 up
6000 mark Q03_AFTERQUIT
9000 mark Q04_LATER
9100 parkbr
9400 mark END
